---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Generator from '../../components/Generator.astro';

const title = 'Low Poly Papercraft Generator — Free 3D Papercraft Designs';
const description = 'Create faceted low poly papercraft designs with the free low poly papercraft generator. Turn a fox, gem, or idea into a geometric AI-generated papercraft design.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} ogType="website">
  <article class="container generator-page">
    <header class="generator-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="label">Low Poly Papercraft Generator</span></p>
      <h1>Generate low poly papercraft</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Geometric, faceted forms for modern art and decor. Describe an idea, pick the Low Poly style, and generate a beautiful papercraft design for inspiration and creative exploration.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Generator app (pre-set to the Low Poly style) -->
    <Generator defaultStyle="lowpoly" defaultPrompt="a low poly fox" />

    <!-- SEO content -->
    <section class="gen-info reveal">
      <h2>What you can make in the Low Poly style</h2>
      <p>
        The low poly papercraft generator is built for angular, faceted shapes — gems, foxes, and
        geometric models with crisp edges. Tell it <strong>a low poly fox</strong>,
        <strong>a crystal</strong>, or <strong>a blocky robot</strong>, and it returns a modern papercraft
        papercraft-style design — original paper art for inspiration.
      </p>

      <h2>How to use a generated design</h2>
      <ol class="gen-steps">
        <li><strong>Describe</strong> an idea above (or just press Generate for a suggestion), then pick your preferred style.</li>
        <li><strong>Generate</strong> your papercraft design — the AI creates a unique papercraft-style artwork in seconds.</li>
        <li><strong>Save</strong> your favorite designs for personal reference, inspiration, or creative exploration.</li>
        <li><strong>Explore</strong> different styles and variations — the same idea renders differently in Cute, Low Poly, Pixel, or Fantasy.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Other styles to try</h2>
      <p>
        Want a different look? The same idea renders differently in
        <a href="/tools/cute/">Cute</a>, <a href="/tools/pixel/">Pixel</a>, or
        <a href="/tools/fantasy/">Fantasy</a>. Browse them all on the
        <a href="/tools/">papercraft generators hub</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="gen-faq">
        <details>
          <summary>Is the low poly generator free?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Every low poly papercraft design is free to generate and download. No account required.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What file do I get?</summary>
          <p>You get a high-resolution papercraft design image, ready to save and reuse as inspiration.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I make blocky cube models?</summary>
          <p>Describe a cube, gem, or blocky character and the generator renders it as a crisp papercraft-style artwork.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <h2>Low poly papercraft style, explained</h2>
      <p>
        The Low Poly style breaks your idea into angular, geometric facets — the look of a modern 3D render
        translated into folded paper. It suits architectural shapes, animals, and anything where clean lines
        and light-catching angles make the design feel sculptural.
      </p>

      <h2>Example prompts that work well</h2>
      <ul class="gen-steps">
        <li><strong>a low poly fox</strong> — sharp facets, classic result</li>
        <li><strong>a geometric mountain</strong> — clean, modern, decor-ready</li>
        <li><strong>a faceted gem crystal</strong> — great for shiny, angular subjects</li>
        <li><strong>a low poly deer head</strong> — sculptural wall-art look</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What the Low Poly style is best for</h2>
      <p>
        Use Low Poly papercraft designs for modern room decor, architectural and nature themes, logo and
        branding inspiration, and any project that wants a clean, contemporary feel. Faceted geometry also
        photographs well, making these designs strong choices for social media visuals.
      </p>

      <h2>Low Poly vs. other styles at a glance</h2>
      <table class="gen-compare">
        <tr><th>Style</th><th>Look</th><th>Best for</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Low Poly</td><td>angular, geometric facets</td><td>architectural shapes, animals, modern decor</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cute</td><td>round, kawaii, soft</td><td>kids' crafts, gifts, friendly mascots</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Pixel</td><td>blocky, 8-bit, grid-based</td><td>game themes, retro icons, chunky subjects</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Fantasy</td><td>magical, luminous, ornate</td><td>castles, dragons, wizards, dream scenes</td></tr>
      </table>

      <h2>Tips for better low poly results</h2>
      <ul class="gen-steps">
        <li>Single, well-defined subjects render the cleanest facets.</li>
        <li>Describe the object plainly — the style adds the geometry for you.</li>
        <li>Compare with the Cute style on the same idea to see how geometry changes mood.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>More frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="gen-faq">
        <details>
          <summary>Do low poly designs work as printable templates?</summary>
          <p>Low poly papercraft designs are inspiration artwork, not cut-and-fold templates. For printable sheet templates, see our <a href="/printables/">free printables library</a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I use a low poly design commercially?</summary>
          <p>Generated designs are for personal inspiration and creative exploration; commercial reuse of the generator output should be checked against our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Does the generator run on my phone?</summary>
          <p>Yes — the low poly generator works in any modern browser on desktop and mobile, with no account needed.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'SoftwareApplication',
    name: 'koPaper Low Poly Papercraft Generator',
    applicationCategory: 'DesignApplication',
    operatingSystem: 'Any',
    offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0', priceCurrency: 'USD' },
    description: 'Free online tool to generate low poly papercraft-style designs from a text idea.',
  })}></script>
</BaseLayout>
